  "detail_text": "GENERAL DESCRIPTION: The purpose of this requirement is to provide the Oklahoma City VA Health Care System with comprehensive preventative maintenance and cleaning services for its inventory of ice machines. The facility has a fleet of 54 individual ice machine units at 2 facilities requiring semi-annual maintenance per each unit s OEM and the hospital s infection control management plan. Official Request for Quote solicitation will be posted at a later time.",
